{"about_the_game":"Midnight Acres was built using Unreal Engine 5 and features a beautiful and dynamic day and night system.<br><u><strong>Daytime Gameplay</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/39622da41129f4a16cade37fdb656c0d.avif?t=1698264723\" width=380 height=214 /></span><br>During the daytime, build and expand your farm and engage in casual and relaxing building &amp; management.<br>Gather resources to upgrade your farm and defenses.<br>Relax by exploring the world for treasures, fishing in various ponds and underground lakes, managing your farm, and more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/518ba20be4805f39862cef2154d9082c.poster.avif?t=1698264723\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/518ba20be4805f39862cef2154d9082c.webm?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/518ba20be4805f39862cef2154d9082c.mp4?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Nighttime Gameplay</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/f71aab4f6aff36f9c41ebfe22615e51b.avif?t=1698264723\" width=380 height=214 /></span><br>When night falls, you must push back hordes of enemies trying to destroy you and your farm.<br>Engage in intense FPS combat with various weapons.<br>Use tower-defense elements to place and upgrade turrets and defenses for your farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/a9ab4215d2263d6d8f61217d81b8c19a.poster.avif?t=1698264723\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/a9ab4215d2263d6d8f61217d81b8c19a.webm?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/a9ab4215d2263d6d8f61217d81b8c19a.mp4?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u><strong><br>Exploration</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/cf5815954be8cc2be5cf48235c78ec7a.poster.avif?t=1698264723\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/cf5815954be8cc2be5cf48235c78ec7a.webm?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/cf5815954be8cc2be5cf48235c78ec7a.mp4?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore a vast world with a sprawling cave system and rare collectibles... but beware. <br>Monsters constantly patrol the underground and guard the most valuable treasures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/bf0ee13ef83ca0dd22e0528144335b7a.poster.avif?t=1698264723\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/bf0ee13ef83ca0dd22e0528144335b7a.webm?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/extras/bf0ee13ef83ca0dd22e0528144335b7a.mp4?t=1698264723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/66733c332056411d43474b90409f924ed64f5da9.jpg"},{"name":"Professional ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/d66f42c8713d8700b7ebb995ed69d7fe1edc33b7.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/6d26d25b878f33f7174b7bfcd90114674d5cc9a5.jpg"},{"name":"Green Thumb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/ce0186a7e367de01fa98222ebe712788f9d82d38.jpg"},{"name":"Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/2d0d17c288cb63b8488a962e0aa8509d566c84c5.jpg"},{"name":"Agriculturalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/ccaa619d9b93149279c3c0f3ee4f1a032416a70a.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/3d2890d98d5ff3660c9c4d3b7c570df06751795a.jpg"},{"name":"Self Defense ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/3afe7297df1335db03758fb8c95ee585e4a205aa.jpg"},{"name":"Turret Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/dec3d776b0f4e93e6a78e77fd51d6255916ebd73.jpg"},{"name":"Raining Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2536420/09554d12707c376c8318183bfff543ba39427858.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2536420?t=1698264723","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2536420?t=1698264723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1698264723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1698264723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descri